WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.715
Close in, only rock.

00:02.415 --> 00:06.296
Near the young Sun, only rocky material could stand the heat.

00:06.746 --> 00:14.073
That is why the four planets closest to the Sun are small and made of rock: Mercury, Venus, the Earth and Mars.

00:14.523 --> 00:19.441
Mercury's surface is still scarred with the craters of countless impacts.
